{
  "_comment": "The closed catalog of product events (plan UX, A6 and section 39): every event a reader's browser (web) or the server (server) may record, each tied to a product decision, with the only properties it may carry. A property is an enumeration, a bounded integer, a boolean, a slug ([a-z0-9_.-], at most 40) or an id - never free text, an address, an IP or a form's content. web/src/lib/track.ts holds the same catalog (a test checks the parity). Nothing here ever reaches a model, the decision layer or the AI's package.",
